  "@type": "Process",
  "critical": false,
  "description": "Precision doping by accelerating ionized dopant species (B⁺, BF₂⁺, P⁺, As⁺) into silicon wafers using a particle accelerator chain: ion source, mass analyzer, acceleration column, and beam scanning system. Replaces thermal diffusion with independent control of dose (10¹¹ to 10¹⁶ ions/cm²) and junction depth (10 to 1000 nm via energy selection from 10 keV to several MeV). Requires high-voltage power, toxic dopant gas handling, and high-vacuum beam lines.",
